From: TB371FC Linux Project <tb371fc-linux@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: nt36523: add Lenovo TB371FC NT36532 panels

The Lenovo TB371FC uses a dual-DSI NT36532 LCD in either BOE or Tianma
configuration. Each link drives 1472x1840 pixels over four D-PHY lanes. The
panel uses DSC 1.1 with two 736-pixel slices per link and one slice per packet
at 8 bits per pixel.

The command tables, reset wiring and timings are derived from Lenovo's stock
TB371FC device tree. Keep both vendor variants explicit so a wrong command
table is never selected by guesswork.
